id=statusbarguard
name=Status Bar Guard
version=v2.1
versionCode=3
author=Omnibot
description=Per-app status bar and notification shade suppression. While a checked app is in the foreground the status bar is blanked and the shade cannot drop; everything is restored elsewhere. WebUI: app list with checkboxes, master mode, live status. Config: /data/adb/statusbarguard/apps.conf
